        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should be resolved in latest `main`.\r\n\r\nThe 'mini.comment' now has `options.start_of_line` option (similar to 'vim-commentary' name) which detects lines as comments only if they don't have indent.\r\n\r\nYour use case should be solved with something like this:\r\n`au FileType asciidoc lua vim.b.minicomment_config = { options = { start_of_line = true } }`",
